.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-admin-payouts-issue - Issue a manual payout for a seller


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad admin payouts issue [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Issue a manual payout for a seller through Stripe or PayPal.

.PP
The --through date is the payout period end date and must be in the past
(YYYY-MM-DD). --split is only valid with --processor paypal and asks the
server to split the payout amount across multiple PayPal transfers.

.PP
--force releases a balance below the $100 payout minimum (e.g. a compliant
creator discontinuing a product who won't reach the threshold). Without it,
sub-minimum balances are rejected, unchanged.

.PP
This moves money. --yes is required.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--expected-email\fP=""
	Optional current email guard

.PP
\fB--force\fP[=false]
	Release a balance below the $100 payout minimum

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for issue

.PP
\fB--processor\fP=""
	Payout processor: stripe or paypal (required)

.PP
\fB--split\fP[=false]
	Split the amount across multiple PayPal transfers (paypal only)

.PP
\fB--through\fP=""
	Payout period end date in YYYY-MM-DD (required, must be in the past)

.PP
\fB--user-id\fP=""
	User external ID (required)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompts


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gumroad admin payouts issue --user-id 2245593582708 --through 2026-04-30 --processor stripe --yes
  gumroad admin payouts issue --user-id 2245593582708 --expected-email seller@example.com --through 2026-04-30 --processor paypal --split --yes
  gumroad admin payouts issue --user-id 2245593582708 --through 2026-04-30 --processor stripe --force --yes
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgumroad-admin-payouts(1)\fP
